    "filename": null,
    "executiveSummary": "On **12 September 2026** an attacker gained access to a finance user's mailbox by stealing a signed-in session through a phishing page. They read mail and set a rule forwarding it outside the company for about 26 hours.\n\nThe account was disabled and the rule removed on 13 September. No funds were transferred.",
    "methodology": null,
    "toolsAndTechniques": null,
    "conclusion": "The incident was contained within 26 hours of initial access and no wire fraud occurred. The root cause was MFA that a stolen session can satisfy; the recommendations above remove that path.",
    "sections": [
      {
        "id": "s0000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000000i1",
